# Hono

Follow `.cursor/skills/hono/SKILL.md` for routes, middleware, and the Node adapter.

Hard rules:

- Thin route handlers — map HTTP ↔ application commands/handlers only
- Wire concrete adapters only in `bootstrap/` (composition root)
- Prefer `app.route("/api/v1/<feature>", featureRoutes)` for versioned APIs
- Validate at the edge; map domain errors to HTTP in presentation
- Test with `app.request()` (Web Fetch API); no Nest TestingModule
